# Fixture payloads are evidence, not build junk: the scanner's test and
# demo fixtures plant fake implants (dist-info METADATA, cook.pth,
# sitecustomize.py, __pycache__ bytecode) inside fake venvs. They must be
# committed -- with the old unanchored `.venv/` rule they were silently
# ignored, CI checked out a tree missing the LL-008/009/010/011/013
# evidence, and pytest failed on every runner while passing locally.
!tests/fixtures/positive/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/__pycache__/
!tests/fixtures/positive/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/__pycache__/cook.cpython-312.pyc
!examples/demo-project/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/__pycache__/
!examples/demo-project/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/__pycache__/cook.cpython-312.pyc
